        "payload": "tree 7961112721cd6a7e2356e30e96f530c9a55919b9\nparent 7988380da987c0b860885853ace8149b84ac2ee8\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790888098 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790889268 +0200\n\ntest: make orphanage_dos_many fill the orphanage\n\ntest_orphanage_dos_many had 60 peers send the same 51 orphans as tx\nmessages. Only the first peer is recorded as announcer: the node ignores\na tx that is already an orphan. The orphanage held at most 152\nannouncements against a limit of 3000, so nothing was evicted and the\ncheck that the normal peer's orphan survives could not fail.\n\nHave the other 59 peers announce the orphans by inv, which does add them\nas announcers, and check that the orphanage holds 3000 announcements.\n\nA node that evicts the normal peer's orphan first now fails this test at\nthe wait for that orphan. Before, it passed.\n",
